Your pets won't attack the priest, they're not high enough level. If I
were you, I would set up boulders around a poly trap using a soko
earth scroll and then use the magic whistle until you get some real
pets, then just let them kill the priest (but don't hit it yourself).

Also, IMO you should work on your AC a bit more, try to find some
studded leather (can probably get it off a minetown watchman), not
sure what else you got but you can get your base ac down to 2 without
any enchantment or spell failure, and probably down another 2-4 points
with one round of divine protection (costs 5200 at xl 13).

Good luck!

